"Missing on Assignment is the official System status of an Avowed lost on a quest."
"It carries a cause, such as Irretrievable due to Teleportation Failure."
"Once survival odds fall below 1%, the status becomes Presumed Dead."
"Death is confirmed only when the incident resolves; next of kin are informed."
"On confirmed death an Avowed's Argold goes to next of kin."
"The summoning institution then pays death compensation."
"The System takes no special measures to rescue a single Avowed."
